<!-- 06 Outcomes -->
<section id="outcomes" class="cs-section">
  <div class="section-eyebrow"><span>06 Outcomes</span></div>
  <h2 class="section-heading">Testing and Early Outcomes</h2>
  <div class="section-row">
    <div class="section-col">
      <p class="section-body">The redesigned journey was prepared for launch in the UK and Sweden, where Toyota was partnering with local energy and services providers. User testing focused primarily on UK users and the participants were guided through the new setup experience and prompted to let us know things like missing information, any points of confusion, and any moments of reassurance or uncertainty.</p>
      <p class="section-body">Results were documented in detail and presented back to stakeholders, helping align product, engineering, and leadership around why the changes mattered, not just what had changed.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px; align-items: start;">
    <img src="/assets/Portfolio/Toyota/Usertesting.png" alt="User testing" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 12px;" />
    <div style="background: #efefef; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; overflow: hidden;">
      <img src="/assets/Portfolio/Toyota/usertesting 2.jpg" alt="User testing 2" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 8px;" />
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="section-row cs-subsection">
    <div class="section-col">
      <h3 class="subsection-heading">Impact and Next Steps</h3>
      <p class="section-body">While this work was completed ahead of launch and did not yet have live performance data, user testing showed a significant improvement in understanding and confidence when setting up Smart Charging. The redesigned journey also helped align product, engineering, and leadership around a shared vision for energy management.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="section-row cs-subsection">
    <div class="section-col">
      <h3 class="subsection-heading">Broadening the Scope After Smart Charging</h3>
      <p class="section-body">Smart Charging (V1G) is just one part of a much bigger energy management piece around charging capabilities between the car and the home. To explore this future state, I worked closely with a Service Designer to define a long-term vision for Toyota's energy management experience. Together, we mapped out how this could all come together into a single, coherent narrative.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
